Package: shaderange
Title: Compare Foundation Shade Ranges with the Market
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Miriam", "Wu", , "mwuu0085@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides foundation shade data collected from Sephora and
    Ulta, with functions for summarising shade supply by lightness band
    and comparing a brand's shade mix with the market. Includes a Shiny
    app that helps beauty product strategists find where a brand offers
    a smaller share of shades than the market, and which competitor
    products lead there.
